  "notes": [
    "player follows the baseline playerTop/unitUpper shell and target follows targetTop/unitLower. Other feature positions are Codex proposals.",
    "partyGroup and grid2.raid are group envelopes. party and grid2.button are individual member sizes.",
    "The three Experience rectangles are an arrangement proposal for a horizontal rail. Upstream stacks the bars vertically and puts text outside them. Safe runtime support is pending and this split is not an automatic profile setting.",
    "Nameplates follow units dynamically. Only font and size candidates can be prepared without measuring the native client structure.",
    "Cooldown viewer bounds reserve space. Native Edit Mode/API and simultaneous existing viewer contents must be confirmed before applying geometry.",
    "The absence of a target, focus, pet or separate Hekili toggle preserves that feature original visibility condition.",
    "Unit child rectangles are Codex proposals for existing enabled frames only; FUF native border extents and integer rounding require live verification. PB4 and FUF are mutually exclusive candidates.",
    "Pet/petTarget/Dominos pet actions/Quartz pet share a left-aligned column. QHD Quartz ends858, eight pixels before focusTarget866. The Dominos pet rectangle is a proposed ten-slot Onyx alpha envelope; actual native size/slot count is read at proposal evaluation, not a live measurement.",
    "Current pet coordinates supersede the previous low-left draft: master/B found original demon art alpha overlap; all four rows translated with their sizes/internal gaps preserved. FHD cast ends542 before focusTarget548; QHD858 before focusTarget866; UHD1632 before actual art1640 and column ends572 before focus580. Art clearance gate belongs to master renderer, not a game observation."
